{"updated": "2026-08-20T04:51:32.972938+00:00", "fetched": 6, "cache_hits": 7, "bundles": {"b225a4dc0c2d": {"label": "cross-asset \u00b7 3 series \u2191", "level": "red", "score": 36.35, "members": ["dyn_mrna", "eth_usd", "btc_usd"], "articles": [{"title": "Moderna\u2019s 177% Surge Burns Shorts in \u2018Painful\u2019 $5.5 Billion Loss", "feed": "Mint Markets", "ts": "2026-08-19T21:38:39+00:00", "url": "https://www.livemint.com/market/modernas-177-surge-burns-shorts-in-painful-5-5-billion-loss-11787175519880.html", "status": "ok", "excerpt": "A record surge in Moderna Inc.\u2019s shares delivered a $5.5 billion blow to short sellers who had bet that the vaccine maker\u2019s years-long slump would continue.\n\nModerna\u2019s stock price soared 177% on Wednesday after the company said its personalized cancer vaccine developed with partner Merck & Co. helped reduce the recurrence of melanoma in a late-stage trial. The jump generated paper losses of about $5.5 billion for short sellers, bringing mark-to-market losses to roughly $7.7 billion this year, according to data from S3 Partners LLC.\n\n\u201cThis is an exceptionally painful move for Moderna shorts,\u201d said Matthew Unterman, managing director at S3 Partners. \u201cToday\u2019s move materially changes the risk/re", "citation": "Moderna\u2019s 177% Surge Burns Shorts in \u2018Painful\u2019 $5.5 Billion Loss \u2014 Mint Markets, 2026-08-19. https://www.livemint.com/market/modernas-177-surge-burns-shorts-in-painful-5-5-billion-loss-11787175519880.html"}, {"title": "Moderna\u2019s cancer-vaccine breakthrough drives broad biopharma stock rally", "feed": "MarketWatch Top", "ts": "2026-08-19T20:28:00+00:00", "url": "https://www.marketwatch.com/story/modernas-cancer-vaccine-breakthrough-drives-broad-biopharma-stock-rally-ff2816aa?mod=mw_rss_topstories", "status": "skipped", "excerpt": "", "citation": "Moderna\u2019s cancer-vaccine breakthrough drives broad biopharma stock rally \u2014 MarketWatch Top, 2026-08-19. https