://www.livemint.com/market/commodities/gold-and-silver-prices-rise-on-mcx-amid-a-softer-dollar-decline-in-the-us-bond-yields-11787197068727.html", "status": "ok", "excerpt": "A softer US dollar and a decline in bond yields triggered buying in precious metals, driving gold and silver prices higher in global markets and in the domestic futures market on Thursday morning.\n\nMCX gold October futures were 0.33% up at \u20b91,58,521 per 10 grams, while MCX silver September contracts were 1.29% up at \u20b92,39,850 per kg around 9:45 AM.\n\nUS gold prices rose to levels near their highest in over two months after a liquidity support announcement by the U.S. Treasury Department dragged yields and the dollar lower.\n\nThe US Treasury Department said it would double the size of liquidity support buyback operations for longer-dated notes and bonds.\n\nThe dollar index declined 0.83% on Wedn", "citation": "Gold and silver prices rise on MCX amid a softer dollar, decline in the US bond yields \u2014 Mint Markets, 2026-08-20. https://www.livemint.com/market/commodities/gold-and-silver-prices-rise-on-mcx-amid-a-softer-dollar-decline-in-the-us-bond-yields-11787197068727.html"}, {"title": "Gold hovers near early-June high on lower bond yields", "feed": "ET Markets", "ts": "2026-08-20T02:00:29+00:00", "url": "https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/commodities/news/gold-hovers-near-early-june-high-on-lower-bond-yields/articleshow/133361826.cms", "status": "ok", "excerpt": "Gold prices soared close to a two-month peak on Thursday after the U.S. Treasury announced bolstered liquidity measures. With yields falling and the dollar weakening, gold became increasingly attractive to investors. This move comes in light of persistent inflation fears and looming interest rate hikes, highlighting gold's reputation as a secure haven during times of financial instability.\n\n(What's moving Sensex and Nifty Track latest market news, stock tips, Budget 2025, Share Market on Budget 2025 and expert advice, on ETMarkets. Also, ETMarkets.com is now on Telegram. For fastest news alerts on financial markets, investment strategies and stocks alerts, subscribe to our Telegram feeds .)\n", "citation": "Gold hovers near early-June high on lower bond yields \u2014 ET Markets, 2026-08-20. https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/commodities/news/gold-hovers-near-early-june-high-on-lower-bond-yields/articleshow/133361826.cms"}], "primary_sources": [{"series": "comex_gold", "name": "Yahoo \u00b7 GC=F", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GC=F"}, {"series": "comex_gold", "name": "CFTC Commitments of Traders", "url": "https://www.cftc.gov/MarketReports/CommitmentsofTraders/index.htm"}, {"series": "comex_silver", "name": "Yahoo \u00b7 SI=F", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/SI=F"}], "analogues": {"member_z_today": {"comex_gold": -1.33, "comex_silver": -0.39, "gold_silver_ratio": -0.02}, "analogues": [{"date": "2026-05-22", "distance": 0.0, "member_z": {"comex_gold": -1.33, "comex_silver": -0.39, "gold_silver_ratio": -0.02}}, {"date": "2026-05-15", "distance": 0.21, "member_z": {"comex_gold": -1.49, "comex_silver": -0.22, "gold_silver_ratio": -0.3}}, {"date": "2025-07-30", "distance": 0.29, "member_z": {"comex_gold": -1.56, "comex_silver": -0.27, "gold_silver_ratio": -0.44}}, {"date": "2024-11-18", "distance": 0.36, "member_z": {"comex_gold": -1.22, "comex_silver": -0.9, "gold_silver_ratio": 0.33}}, {"date": "2026-03-31", "distance": 0.41, "member_z": {"comex_gold": -0.65, "comex_silver": -0.42, "gold_silver_ratio": -0.24}}], "aftermath": {"comex_gold": {"stats": {"+5d": {"n": 5, "median_pct": 0.24, "hit_rate_up": 0.8, "min_pct": -0.76, "max_pct": 2.55}, "+20d": {"n": 4, "median_pct": 0.27, "hit_rate_up": 0.5, "min_pct": -7.48, "max_pct": 3.3}}, "median_path": [0.0, -0.07, 0.08, 0.2, 0.87, 0.24, 0.37, 1.12, 1.74, 0.93, 1.31, 1.2, 0.61, 1.07, 0.53, 1.44, 1.24, 1.61, 0.6]}, "comex_silver": {"stats": {"+5d": {"n": 5, "median_pct": -1.64, "hit_rate_up": 0.2, "m