 "url": "https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/bonds/selloff-in-euro-zone-bonds-pauses-but-oil-prices-keep-up-pressure/articleshow/133341510.cms", "status": "ok", "excerpt": "Government bond yields across the euro zone halted their upward trend on Wednesday, with the U.S. Treasury market finding stability and contributing positively to global sentiment. However, the ongoing surge in oil prices maintained upward pressure on markets. Concerns about inflation and borrowing led to notable selling in longer-dated bonds, with France's 30-year yield experiencing a remarkable increase, especially during the budget season and electoral period.\n\nOnline platforms now offer retail investors access to corporate bonds. These securities provide mid-teen yields with low minimum investments. Retail investors are increasingly participating in the corporate bond market. This trend ", "citation": "Selloff in euro zone bonds pauses but oil prices keep up pressure \u2014 ET Markets, 2026-08-19. https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/bonds/selloff-in-euro-zone-bonds-pauses-but-oil-prices-keep-up-pressure/articleshow/133341510.cms"}, {"title": "ECB'S LANE: EURO ZONE INFLATION ONE PERCENTAGE POINT ABOVE ECB'S 2% TARGET IS A LOT", "feed": "DeItaone", "ts": "2026-08-18T13:03:37+00:00", "url": "https://t.me/walter_bloomberg/34837", "status": "partial", "excerpt": "", "citation": "ECB'S LANE: EURO ZONE INFLATION ONE PERCENTAGE POINT ABOVE ECB'S 2% TARGET IS A LOT \u2014 DeItaone, 2026-08-18. https://t.me/walter_bloomberg/34837"}, {"title": "Euro zone bonds join global selloff, long-end yields at multi-year highs", "feed": "ET Markets", "ts": "2026-08-18T12:02:45+00:00", "url": "https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/bonds/euro-zone-bonds-join-global-selloff-long-end-yields-at-multi-year-highs/articleshow/133321858.cms", "status": "ok", "excerpt": "On Tuesday, yields on longer-dated euro zone bonds surged to levels not seen in years. The increasing oil prices, spurred by diminishing expectations for a quick resolution to the conflict in Iran, intensified inflation worries throughout the markets. Consequently, investors are anticipating a quarter-point interest rate hike from the ECB, while apprehensions about fiscal stability in various nations add pressure on global bonds.\n\nGlobal borrowing costs are hitting multi-decade highs again as inflation fears rise. The United States has seen its 30-year Treasury yields surpassing five percent, while Japan's 10-year borrowing costs approach a peak not seen in nearly 30 years. Additionally, lon", "citation": "Euro zone bonds join global selloff, long-end yields at multi-year highs \u2014 ET Markets, 2026-08-18. https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/bonds/euro-zone-bonds-join-global-selloff-long-end-yields-at-multi-year-highs/articleshow/133321858.cms"}], "primary_sources": [{"series": "eur_usd", "name": "Yahoo \u00b7 EURUSD=X", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/EURUSD=X"}, {"series": "gbp_usd", "name": "Yahoo \u00b7 GBPUSD=X", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GBPUSD=X"}, {"series": "aud_usd", "name": "Yahoo \u00b7 AUDUSD=X", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AUDUSD=X"}, {"series": "usd_mxn", "name": "Yahoo \u00b7 MXN=X", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/MXN=X"}], "analogues": {"member_z_today": {"eur_usd": -0.25, "gbp_usd": 1.25, "aud_usd": -0.28, "usd_mxn": 0.92}, "analogues": [{"date": "2026-07-10", "distance": 0.0, "member_z": {"eur_usd": -0.25, "gbp_usd": 1.25, "aud_usd": -0.28, "usd_mxn": 0.92}}, {"date": "2025-08-15", "distance": 0.23, "member_z": {"eur_usd": 0.17, "gbp_usd": 1.15, "aud_usd": -0.44, "usd_mxn": 1.04}}, {"date": "2025-03-31", "distance": 0.52, "member_z": {"eur_usd": 0.2, "gbp_usd": 0.36, "aud_usd": -0.51, "usd_mxn": 0.77}}, {"date": "2025-01-31", "distance": 0.52, "member_z": {"eur_usd": 0.66, "gbp_usd": 0.77, "aud_usd": -0.44, "usd_mxn": 0.91}}, {"date": "2026-05-05", "distance": 0.59, "member_z": {"eur_usd": -0.45, "gbp_usd": 0.5, "aud_